    """Fill blank gutters next to colored 3x3 patch centers.

    The 5x5 framed blocks repeat every 7 cells. Color 2 is the ordinary
    patch color in this task; other patch colors mark the center of a signal.
    For each signal center, extend its color through the neighboring gutter
    toward the right and downward, leaving all framed cells unchanged.
